<title>USA: Integrated Waste dismantles subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Integrated Waste dismantles subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>BUFFALO, N.Y. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Integrated Waste Services Inc said on Friday it is &quot;winding down&quot; operations at its U.S. Dismantlement Corp subsidiary in Chicago, finishing current projects but taking on no new business.</p>
<p>U.S. Dismantlement's equipment, real estate and other assets will be sold off as soon as is practical, the company said.</p>
<p>Integrated Waste provides demolition and dismantlement, environmental contracting, industrial cleaning, and related services to governmental, industrial and commercial customers.</p>
</text>
